==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dashing Face]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Dashing Face may be fast, but is quite weak here so a few meatshields and attackers will be enough to stall it and defeat it. Alternatively, you can send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to instantly kill Dashing Face and win the battle.

